  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi></math> are two complex numbers such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, then:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>&#969;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>&#969;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>&#969;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>We know that, if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>,</mo></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>&#969;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p>Now, by using Euler form i.e. if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we have&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></msup></math> and <math><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Using polar form i.e. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
  }
}